{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you will meet Pon, a friendly but lazy Tanuki with a Post Office gig, on a divine mission to restore the shrine before summer\u2019s over! Enjoy over an hour of Tanuki-packed content, featuring freestyle BMX riding with a growing list of tricks, a vibrant cast of seven characters, multiple quests and activities, and even a chance to decorate your own shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/Main_Title.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deliver packages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop on your BMX and deliver letters and packages to the quirky inhabitants of Tanuki's four towns. Packages vary in size, weight, and shape so it'll be up to you to strategise how you approach each delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/Tanuki_BMPX.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Activities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you build up friendship and loyalty with the inhabitants, they'll invite you to a wide range of sports and activities. Take part to unlock items and rewards that will help with the shrine's restoration.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/Activities.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Restore the shrine to former glory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, upgrade and decorate the shrine with the money and items you earn through deliveries and activities. Get the shrine ready for the festival at the end of summer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/Shrining.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Four Major Towns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore four major towns, lovingly inspired by Kyoto, Aomori, Sapporo, and Beppu. Each with their own quests and objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/People.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the Tanuki Festival just around the corner, Pon must restore the shrine to its former glory. Help him earn cash, befriend the local townsfolk, and prep the shrine for the festival of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BMX your way into the hearts of all the townsfolk as a mail delivery Tanuki! You've got one month to save up enough to restore the shrine for the Great Tanuki Festival. Deliver packages, compete in sports, make sushi, and much much more in <i>Tanuki!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764960?t=1753413794","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764960?t=1753413794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/c647a65ed28c66c46b604c021af336d889b75d82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753413794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/c647a65ed28c66c46b604c021af336d889b75d82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753413794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you will meet Pon, a friendly but lazy Tanuki with a Post Office gig, on a divine mission to restore the shrine before summer\u2019s over! Enjoy over an hour of Tanuki-packed content, featuring freestyle BMX riding with a growing list of tricks, a vibrant cast of seven characters, multiple quests and activities, and even a chance to decorate your own shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/Main_Title.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deliver packages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop on your BMX and deliver letters and packages to the quirky inhabitants of Tanuki's four towns. Packages vary in size, weight, and shape so it'll be up to you to strategise how you approach each delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/Tanuki_BMPX.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Activities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you build up friendship and loyalty with the inhabitants, they'll invite you to a wide range of sports and activities. Take part to unlock items and rewards that will help with the shrine's restoration.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/Activities.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Restore the shrine to former glory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, upgrade and decorate the shrine with the money and items you earn through deliveries and activities. Get the shrine ready for the festival at the end of summer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/Shrining.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Four Major Towns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore four major towns, lovingly inspired by Kyoto, Aomori, Sapporo, and Beppu. Each with their own quests and objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/extras/People.gif?t=1753413794\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the Tanuki Festival just around the corner, Pon must restore the shrine to its former glory. Help him earn cash, befriend the local townsfolk, and prep the shrine for the festival of a lifetime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BMX your way into the hearts of all the townsfolk as a mail delivery Tanuki! You've got one month to save up enough to restore the shrine for the Great Tanuki Festival. Deliver packages, compete in sports, make sushi, and much much more in <i>Tanuki!</i></p>","developers":["Denkiworks"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3218570","name":"TANUKI: Pon's Summer"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/2f833bf742e6419168299da53d8bc202fbc984e1/header.jpg?t=1753413794","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173622,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173622/movie480.mp4?t=1753413793","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173622/movie_max.mp4?t=1753413793"},"name":"Demo Trailer [EN]","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173622/50099bcc632debfc7f47b0ddf09a28be0e84712b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753413793","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_