413794"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/12646f760e9cbf82b5daf2d8a9e3c0f75e38cc8c/ss_12646f760e9cbf82b5daf2d8a9e3c0f75e38cc8c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1753413794","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/12646f760e9cbf82b5daf2d8a9e3c0f75e38cc8c/ss_12646f760e9cbf82b5daf2d8a9e3c0f75e38cc8c.600x338.jpg?t=1753413794"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/abb6aba5e7ec922ab0e1b88e6dabd7e637851d0a/ss_abb6aba5e7ec922ab0e1b88e6dabd7e637851d0a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1753413794","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764960/abb6aba5e7ec922ab0e1b88e6dabd7e637851d0a/ss_abb6aba5e7ec922ab0e1b88e6dabd7e637851d0a.600x338.jpg?t=1753413794"}],"short_description":"The Tanuki Festival is just a month away, and the shrine is in disrepair. Follow Pon, a well meaning, if a bit lazy Tanuki with a part-time job at the Post Office, as he works to restore the shrine before summer ends. Deliver packages, make friends, and get the shrine ready for the big festival!","steam_appid":3764960,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"support@criticalreflex.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese","type":"demo","website":null}